{
 "total": 26.7,
 "planned": false,
 "beats": [
  {
   "text": "This is not what a blobfish really looks like.",
   "visual": "hook",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.371
  },
  {
   "text": "That droopy face is actually an injury.",
   "visual": "blob",
   "start": 2.371,
   "end": 4.852
  },
  {
   "text": "Blobfish live up to twelve hundred meters down.",
   "visual": "depth",
   "start": 4.852,
   "end": 7.723
  },
  {
   "text": "There the crushing pressure holds their soft bodies in shape.",
   "visual": "pressure",
   "start": 7.723,
   "end": 10.788
  },
  {
   "text": "Their jelly-like flesh is lighter than water.",
   "visual": "jelly",
   "start": 10.788,
   "end": 13.377
  },
  {
   "text": "So they float above the seafloor without wasting energy.",
   "visual": "float",
   "start": 13.377,
   "end": 16.369
  },
  {
   "text": "Pull one up too fast and the body collapses.",
   "visual": "collapse",
   "start": 16.369,
   "end": 19.058
  },
  {
   "text": "Down in the deep it looks like a normal fish.",
   "visual": "normal",
   "start": 19.058,
   "end": 21.598
  },
  {
   "text": "So next time someone shows you the blob, tell them.",
   "visual": "loop",
   "start": 21.598,
   "end": 26.7
  }
 ],
